    <!-- https://www.easi.uni-bayreuth.de/crossnfi#inYear -->

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="https://www.easi.uni-bayreuth.de/crossnfi#inYear">
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer"/>
        <skos:note xml:lang="en">relates time indexed entities to a year,

For Forest Inventories this is either the year of the cutoff date (BWI, IFN) or the year most of the measurements took place (FIA). Other time indexed entities inherit their time index by the Forest Inventory they are related to.

The datatype is `xsd:integer` because OWL does not use `xsd:gYear` and `xsd:datetime` is too cumbersome</skos:note>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="es">en el año</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">im Jahr</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">in year</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>
    


